        <mxCell id="21ea969265ad0168-8" value="The story begins with salem trying to fix his time travel machine. Here the player, who is the ai robot assistant of salem in the narrative, will learn about the contexte of the game, while exploring salems garage and searching for a ranch for salem." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="21ea969265ad0168-6" vertex="1">
