        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-2" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Salem is a brilliant physicist and innovator who has&lt;br/&gt;discovered stable nuclear fusion power, unlocking new possibilities for&lt;br/&gt;innovation. He&#39;s not only a physics genius but also a computer science whiz&lt;br/&gt;who&#39;s created a groundbreaking AI system (the player) to collaborate on his&lt;br/&gt;work and help him achieve his goals. Salem is deeply dissatisfied with his&lt;br/&gt;Qatari identity, resenting the British colonial influence on Qatar&#39;s culture&lt;br/&gt;and the dominance of English over Arabic. In an attempt to rectify this, Salem&lt;br/&gt;has devised an audacious plan. As time travel to the past remains an&lt;br/&gt;insurmountable obstacle in 2030, he opted to embark on a journey into the&lt;br/&gt;future, a scientifically plausible endeavor made practically attainable by the&lt;br/&gt;abundant energy from his groundbreaking stable nuclear fusion reactor. In this&lt;br/&gt;uncharted future, he hopes to discover technological advancements and a new&lt;br/&gt;understanding of the universe that may hold the key to his mission. After six&lt;br/&gt;months of work, he&#39;s nearly completed his time-traveling machine when the game&lt;br/&gt;begins.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-1">
          <mxGeometry y="26" width="160" height="674" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
